  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterStreet1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - Eve! I was looking for you. Where have you been?
  - "Uh\u2026 well, I woke up, then trained, then showered, then ate in my room and
    made a plan. What kind of plan \u2014 I\u2019m not telling. "
  - "That\u2019s\u2026 not exactly what I meant, but fine. I\u2019m partially here
    on business."
  - So not just like that?..
  - "That too. Anyway\u2014Ferret complained about you."
  - Huh?...
  - "Let me finish. She says she sleeps terribly because almost every night she hears
    someone crying\u2026"
  - "and sometimes\u2026 like someone\u2019s hitting their head against something?"
  - You want to tell me anything?
  - "That\u2019s a lie. Completely. None of that happens. Did she send you to distract
    me so I wouldn\u2019t interfere while she argues with Beast? "
  - "No. In case you haven\u2019t noticed, I come up to you constantly anyway. And
    I said I\u2019m here on business, not to accuse you. "
  - "Are you sure you\u2019re okay? I\u2019m not asking you to describe your childhood
    or anything\u2026 But when we walked in the park, you looked\u2026 content. You
    even said you feel lonely. "
  - "Alright. Maybe not a total lie. But I\u2019m not saying anything else."
  - "And you don\u2019t have to. I brought you something. "
  - "What?.. Is that an army token or something? People usually give those when they\u2019re
    about to self-terminate. "
  - "I\u2019m not planning to. I just thought\u2026 the calls are frequent, and you
    spend most of your time alone in your office. "
  - "And you said you like metal and stones because they\u2019re\u2026 \u201Ctasty\u201D?
    Anyway, maybe if you fiddle with it when no one\u2019s around, you won\u2019t
    feel so alone. "
  - "\u2026.."
  - "*quietly*: And now you can think you\u2019re not alone\u2014because if someone
    gave you something, it means there\u2019s someone who did."
  - 'I like it. A little. Thank you. I like numbers. And metal. '
  - "Yeah. And \u201Colder Asian boys,\u201D too."
  - "You\u2019re impossible."
  - "That wasn\u2019t me\u2014that was Beast. Though I still think he might be right\u2026 "
  - "Topic closed. I\u2019m keeping the gift, you\u2019re staying quiet, and\u2026
    after today\u2019s calls, we\u2019re going somewhere again. I don\u2019t want
    to be here. "
  - Noted.
